# HimmelCAD interop test fixture: an object with two groups.
# "base": a 20 x 10 x 2 box written with quads (fan-triangulated on import).
# "pin": a triangular prism with per-vertex colours (0.2, 0.4, 0.6) and
# negative (relative) face indices. Units: none (OBJ has no unit).
mtllib bracket.mtl
o Bracket
g base
usemtl steel
v 0 0 0
v 20 0 0
v 20 10 0
v 0 10 0
v 0 0 2
v 20 0 2
v 20 10 2
v 0 10 2
vn 0 0 1
f 1 4 3 2
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 2 6 5
f 2 3 7 6
f 3 4 8 7
f 4 1 5 8
g pin
v 5 5 2 0.2 0.4 0.6
v 7 5 2 0.2 0.4 0.6
v 5 7 2 0.2 0.4 0.6
v 5 5 8 0.2 0.4 0.6
v 7 5 8 0.2 0.4 0.6
v 5 7 8 0.2 0.4 0.6
f -6 -4 -5
f -3 -2 -1
f -6 -5 -2 -3
f -5 -4 -1 -2
f -4 -6 -3 -1
